properties.description:
Three tool-level cases:
- review_relations with other_design, and search's `linked` naming the design and the far node;
- add_decision related_to with other_design, read back by upstream_status `references`;
- loop_status naming a link into an undeclared design under cross_design_links. It caught loop_status skipping the upstream read for a design with links and no pins.
On main, other_design is refused as an unknown field.
